<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f8f8f8;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            box-shadow: 0px 0px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        .header {
            background-color: #e5cf45;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 5px 5px 0 0;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .content h2 {
            color: #333333;
        }

        .details {
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            padding: 10px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .details p {
            margin: 5px 0;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #888888;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #4CAF50;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="logo" style="text-align: center;">
                <a href="#">
                    <img style="width: 100px; height: auto;"
                        src="https://demoserver3.sgp1.digitaloceanspaces.com/demoserver3/live/1773638305912.png" alt="logo">
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <h2>Hello {{driverName}},</h2>
            <p>We hope you had a great week! Here is your payout summary for the week:</p>
            <div class="details">
                <p><strong>Week:</strong> {{weekStart}} to {{weekEnd}}</p>
                <p><strong>Total Delivery Charge Amount:</strong> ${{totalDeliveryCharge}}</p>
                <p><strong>Total Commission Amount:</strong> ${{totalCommission}}</p>
                <hr>
                <p><strong>Net Payout Amount:</strong> ${{netPayout}}</p>
            </div>
            <p>The net payout amount has been successfully transferred to your bank account. If you have any questions
                or need further information, feel free to contact us.</p>
            <p>To download your invoice, kindly click the link below:</p>

            <a href="{{invoiceLink}}">Invoice </a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Best regards,<br>The ReadyDeliveries Team</p>
            <td style="font-weight: 400;color: rgba(18, 18, 18, 1); font-size: 16px; line-height: 22px;">

                <button
                    style="border: 0px; width: 100%; padding: 12px 20px;
                                                        color: rgba(130, 130, 130, 1); font-weight: 500 ;font-size:12px;
                                                        background-color: rgba(246, 246, 246, 1); text-align: center; border-radius: 5px;">
                    Copyright © 2024 ReadyDeliveries, All Rights Reserved.
                </button>
            </td>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>